## Verifying the download

```
gpg --verify SHA256SUMS.sig SHA256SUMS
sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS
```

`SHA256SUMS.sig` is a detached signature made with the release key
`$signing_key`. Verify the checksum file first, then the files it lists.

